<p class="kt-adv-heading2515_46537f-47 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading2515_46537f-47">Our downtown located event space is the best solution to organize events from smaller workshops to bigger panel discussions. Fully equipped with a projector, sound system and flexible set up to be tailored for your event. Only your creativity sets the boundaries.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns2515_b13407-d4 kt-btn-align-undefined"><a class="kb-button kt-button button kb-btn2515_314f3d-ea kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto wp-block-button__link kb-btn-global-inherit kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-true animated-cta-btn wp-block-kadence-singlebtn kb-preset--theme-base" href="https://create26.hu/en/tour-booking-appointment/"><span class="kt-btn-inner-text">Book tour</span><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fe_arrowRight kt-btn-icon-side-right"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"  fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span></a></div>
</div></div>



