<h2 class="kt-adv-heading2694_4fb01b-df gradient-bcg wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading2694_4fb01b-df">Possibility for Team Rotation</h2>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading2694_7e8f2e-6e wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading2694_7e8f2e-6e">Do you need a modern, flexible and adaptable office space?</h4>



<h4 class="kt-adv-heading2694_9dbff0-a9 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading2694_9dbff0-a9">Do you want to keep your team engaged, save money and decide how many people can access the office?</h4>



<h5 class="kt-adv-heading2694_96df62-09 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading2694_96df62-09">Our Team Rotation Membership is the solution!</h5>



<p class="kt-adv-heading2694_eaa62f-72 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading2694_eaa62f-72"><br>Extra access cards give your team the opportunity to choose when they work from the office on a rotation-based system. It allows you to be as flexible as you want without paying for empty office space.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns2694_2594da-9c kt-btn-align-undefined"><a class="kb-button kt-button button kb-btn2694_754648-ba kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto wp-block-button__link kb-btn-global-inherit kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-true wp-block-kadence-singlebtn kb-preset--theme-base" href="https://create26.hu/en/office-rental-inquiry/"><span class="kt-btn-inner-text">I&#8217;m interested</span><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fe_arrowRight kt-btn-icon-side-right"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"  fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span></a></div>
</div></div>

